  "description": "Si-an, a man seemingly lacking nothing—his career, family background, even his looks. Into this seemingly flawless life, a baby suddenly appears?\n\nA newborn baby, handed over by his ex-girlfriend who suddenly reappeared, claiming it was his. Suddenly thrust into fatherhood, Si-an frantically searches for a babysitter. But the babysitter who arrives, Geon-hyeok, is somehow a man of enormous stature and an impressive(?) face! The reluctant cohabitation with this burly male babysitter gradually takes a peculiar turn as their time together accumulates…!\n\nA sweet family romance between parenting novice Level 0 Si-an and parenting master Level 99 Geon-hyeok.\n\n---\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[RIDI](https://ridibooks.com/books/1434001548), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/papa_to_papa), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/PaPa_2PaPa)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_0000059)",
